    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1266-a1">

                <pb facs="1146" n="888" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg888"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Telegram—Paraphrase]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commandant of the Naval Station at Guam</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Maxwell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of the Navy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Daniels</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guam</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 10, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have established censorship over the cable. The company demurred over censorship
                    but commandant has taken charge of office.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Maxwell</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
